### 3. Application Service Layer

**파일 위치**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/application/index/service/`

#### 3.1 MallApplicationService.kt
```kotlin
@Service
class MallApplicationService(
    private val mallProxyReader: MallProxyReader,
    private val mallRepository: MallRepository,
    mallGlobalCache: GlobalCache<Int, MallProjection>,
