### 4. Shared Cache Infrastructure

**파일 위치**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/shared/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/shared/cache/`

#### 4.1 Cache 인터페이스

**LocalCache.kt**
```kotlin
interface LocalCache<ID, V> {
    fun get(id: ID): V?
    fun getAll(ids: Collection<ID>): Map<ID, V?>
    fun put(id: ID, value: V)
    fun putAll(values: Map<ID, V>)
}
```

**GlobalCache.kt**
```kotlin
interface GlobalCache<ID, V> {
    fun getAll(ids: Collection<ID>): Map<ID, V?>
    fun putAll(values: Map<ID, V>)
}
```

**TieredLoadingCache.kt**
```kotlin
interface TieredLoadingCache<ID, V> {
    fun get(id: ID): V?
    fun getAll(ids: Collection<ID>): Map<ID, V?>
}
```

#### 4.2 DefaultTieredLoadingCache.kt
```kotlin
class DefaultTieredLoadingCache<ID, V>(
    private val localCache: LocalCache<ID, V>,
    private val globalCache: GlobalCache<ID, V>,
    private val fetcher: (Collection<ID>) -> Map<ID, V>,
) : TieredLoadingCache<ID, V> {
    override fun get(id: ID): V?
    override fun getAll(ids: Collection<ID>): Map<ID, V?>
}
```

**핵심 로직**:
1. L1 (Local Cache) 조회
2. L1 miss시 L2 (Global Cache) 조회 및 L1에 저장
3. L2 miss시 L3 (Fetcher) 호출 및 L1, L2에 저장
4. 모두 miss시 null 반환

**getAll 메서드 동작**:
```kotlin
override fun getAll(ids: Collection<ID>): Map<ID, V?> {
    // 1. L1 조회
    val localCached = localCache.getAll(ids)
    val localMiss = localCached.filterValues { it == null }
    if (localMiss.keys.isEmpty()) return localCached

    // 2. L2 조회
    val globalCached = globalCache.getAll(localMiss.keys)
    val globalHit = globalCached.filterValues { it != null }
    val globalMiss = globalCached.filterValues { it == null }
    if (globalHit.isNotEmpty()) localCache.putAll(globalHit)
    if (globalMiss.isEmpty()) return localCached + globalCached

    // 3. L3 조회
    val fetched = fetcher(globalMiss.keys)
    if (fetched.isNotEmpty()) {
        localCache.putAll(fetched)
        globalCache.putAll(fetched)
    }

    return localCached + globalCached + fetched
}
```

#### 4.3 DefaultLocalCache.kt
```kotlin
class DefaultLocalCache<ID : Any, V : Any>(
    val cache: Cache<String, V>,  // Caffeine Cache
    val keyPrefix: String,
) : LocalCache<ID, V>
```
- Caffeine Cache 래퍼
- 키 변환: `"$keyPrefix:id"`
- 주의: 현재 구현에 버그 있음 (`"$keyPrefix:id"`는 실제 ID 값을 사용하지 않음)

#### 4.4 Factory 클래스

**LocalCacheFactory.kt**
```kotlin
object LocalCacheFactory {
    fun <ID : Any, V : Any> create(
        keyPrefix: String,
        maxSize: Long = 1_000_000,
        ttlSeconds: Long = 60,
